---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base";

const meta = {
	title: "About",
	description: "About Evey Huang",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<section>
		<div class="section-head">
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p class="section-label">Bio</p>
		</div>
		<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5">
			<p>
				I am Evey Huang, a Research Assistant Professor at Northwestern University’s Kellogg School of Management. I study how AI changes the way people
				work together and how to design AI that supports collective work.
			</p>
			<p>
				My research combines human-computer interaction and computational social science. Across
				science, entrepreneurship, and knowledge work, I examine how collaborators make expertise
				usable, how interaction shapes collective work, and how AI affects the diversity of ideas
				and judgments. I connect close observation of work with computational analysis and the
				design and field study of new systems.
			</p>
			<p>
				I earned my PhD in Technology and Social Behavior at Northwestern, a joint program in
				Computer Science and Communication Studies. My doctoral research grew out of a sustained
				partnership with an entrepreneurship incubator. I also coached undergraduate engineering
				students in human-centered design and engineering practices.
			</p>
			<p>
				Alongside academic research, I contribute to AI design and engineering projects in industry.
				Outside work, I enjoy guitar, photography, tennis, reading, doodling, and cooking spicy food.
			</p>
			<p><a class="cactus-link" href="/posts">Explore my research</a> · <a class="cactus-link" href="/resume">View my CV</a></p>
		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
